Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my struggles\Nshoot me through the sky It'd be a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,if we lingered here And let our pretty\Nsparks of life flindle out and disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves cast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart had drift It's\Nbeen your kindness and your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,strength That would free me\Nfrom the mist And just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on Sail to a\Nnew dawn Weigh anchor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,ride as high as you can I assure,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anger I go fast as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I hear you laughing like you're numb\Nto it all While we're dashing together No,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we're never gonna fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you know The whole world may\Nnow be my enemy What a swirl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ain't backing\Ndown so long as I'm free
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.32,0:01:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd give it, come round\Nthe current with me All in,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,wake up bright and early,\Nmaking for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite our best efforts,\NNika has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And two emperors of the sea\Nhave fallen simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to conceal this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the news will\Nspread across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing couldn't be any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to act now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lot of zeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the island disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it walked away slowly into fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't going to open the borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Guano will remain an iron-tight fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems they gauged the\Nsituation and changed plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's in charge now is no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And any hope we had of sending in a\Nbattalion has been completely dashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you at least bring her to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamming, Shailo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.38,0:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've screwed up enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to clean up your mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As news spreads of Kaido's defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of Wano rejoices after facing\N20 years of tyranny and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Drake, are you a\Nmarine, or are you a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like hell, you know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you could spare\Nyourself by joining Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet on the wrong horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I bowed to Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When I saw that monster, I\Nknew he could crush me at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid and Killer, on the other\Nhand, show no fear at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They stared death right in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I'd foreseen the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that they would win in the\Nend, I couldn't face them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a traitor and a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wasn't destined to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your prediction was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did someone else only have a 1% chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making a fall of me, stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows some and\NI don't get hungry! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take down the Fyre\NFestival decorations just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, I mean, the Shogun has\Ndecreed that we'll have another celebration!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There have been some changes, so\Nstarting today, I'll be your new teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen to Miss Sarahebi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she was fun, I'm afraid that\Neverything she taught you is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you about the land of\NWano's true heroes from the very start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The first hero we're going to talk\Nabout is a man named Kozuki Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he was even a year\Nold, he sent his nanny flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When he was four, he knocked out a bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, that was a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.52,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that Lady Komurasaki, the\Nmost beautiful woman in the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,was Lord Oden's daughter,\Nand we never knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved from a burning castle by\Nthe loyal samurai, Sir Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful tale\Nof courage and loyalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of loyal samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Denjiro of the Akazaya 9 disguised\Nhimself as a Yakuza to stay by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling himself Kyoshiro, he\Nprotected her all those years!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know who took\Ndown Kaido in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was someone named\NJoy Boy from what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he already left the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a hero, just like\Nthe god of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to build temples?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ones like Ryuma's gravesite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,starting with one dedicated to Lord Odin\Non a hill overlooking the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll build more near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,One for Sir Yasui, and then ones\Nfor each of the other daimyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For Ashida and Izo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Honimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That tickles you, little rascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see you're alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This reminds me of old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll always be our comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you fought for this country, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When our time comes, we'll be laid\Nto rest right next to Izo and Ashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll bury Izo here, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Izo's home, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's what he would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe,\Nbut I survived again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems we did as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm happy to see this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it won't feel right if\Nthe ones who saved us die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My purpose has been fulfilled,\Nbut they can do so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy, Taro, and Zorojuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lufi, Taro, and Zorojuro are awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.14,0:09:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It was still quite the\Ntomboy, it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring those!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you're awake, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay, and I'm so\Nglad! How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well too soon\Nto drink that much food?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let the man celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally time to\Nget this party started!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon yes, but not just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't spoil your appetite, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for\Nyou to wake up the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,country has been planning\Na banquet in your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall have it today
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you not know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, you're all cool and grown up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your new body looks pretty strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Must take after Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.74,0:11:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me punch you and see. Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those brutes are bullying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Odor, make them all go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only eight years old, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, he's still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, he's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He can take a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the world of\Nadults, Momo. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That baby face can't\Nprotect you now, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, now you look more like your\Nfather, even if you're a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't put trace on my head\Nevery time you see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your parents to thank\Nfor that strong, sturdy body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a little time, and you'll be\Nthe finest samurai in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We should take a bath before the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your prayer was answered, so you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Prayer? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a custom in Wano where you make a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,wish and give something\Nup until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as a way to show\Nthe gods your sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you two to get further,\Nsir, until that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave up taking baths and eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.38,0:12:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Yamabro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me heal right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So thoughtful, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of baths, how\Nthe heck am I so clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:13:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because I wiped you\Ndown myself from head to toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that pleases you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosshead, I think we\Nneed to have a talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But after the battle, there's a chance\NI might not be in my right mind anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happens, then kill me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I crawled back from the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All so I could kill you, cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it worked out, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of looks like you lost\Nyour mind a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you drive me crazy,\Nlike you would any sane person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your ship right for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who crawled back from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to kill you. There they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mixed bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:14:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'd\Nlove to accompany you. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Factor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Yamato, are you sure you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing better than sharing\Na nice bath with your friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, except sharing a feast, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.64,0:14:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a bath, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be as\Nbewitching as you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so warm and steamy. It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to bathe like this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With Lord Odin and the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're the only men I've ever\Nfelt comfortable bathing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You look exactly the same as you did then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange to think\NI'm older than you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This sure feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really, really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They said the banquet is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the revival of the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let all the regents know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonny's looking spiffy now All right,\Nwe can take off as soon as we like
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking good too, General Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we get a giant robot too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't get too cozy if I were you We
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.64,0:15:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know what might\Nhappen before we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure information leaked out somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,so the press probably\Nknows what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With two emperors out of the picture, we'll\Nbe the prime candidates to replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This country may isolate\Nus from our enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but we don't know what\Nthey're plotting now, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the bounties for\Nour captains went up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me feel cool,\Nbut it's also scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you're right the bounties went up sure\Nenough don't know who leaked the info though
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,don't play dumb with us you\Njackass we all know you leaked it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,i let the news out but\Ni let some news in too
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,check it out yo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,fresh off the presses brand\Nspanking new bounties as well as
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,some familiar faces who have just\Nbeen dubbed emperors of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked where you are right now, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:16:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Sakazuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The air over what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can see the land of\NWano from here, if that helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I do.
